    "detailed_description": "In this FPS Roguelike, you'll be fighting enemies and bosses with distinctive behaviors while traversing through a procedurally generated Aztecan temple. Finding game-changing weapon upgrade synergies and learning how to hastily maneuver through the temple will be key if you want to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Up Your Weapons With Synergistic Upgrades</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.poster.avif?t=1709159007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.webm?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.mp4?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Avanzar is an FPS Roguelike that handles weapon upgrades like no other. Want to shoot homing bees instead of bullets? You got it! Want to put those bees on fire? Why not! <br><br>How about a gatling gun that briefly gains infinite ammo after each kill? We've got you covered. Gain nearly limitless possibilities by combining any weapon upgrades you want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Movement Mechanics</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.poster.avif?t=1709159007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.webm?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.mp4?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Wall run, slide, sprint, and bunnyhop your way through the temple at breakneck speed! Earn greater rewards by quickly navigating through treasure rooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take on Unique Enemies and Bosses</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/85b206d287b0e7b693316e751c032622.poster.avif?t=1709159007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/85b206d287b0e7b693316e751c032622.webm?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/85b206d287b0e7b693316e751c032622.mp4?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The gang's all here \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc22\ud83d\udc0a\ud83d\udc0d\ud83c\udf5e\ud83d\udc15\ud83d\udd77\ud83e\udd87",
    "about_the_game": "In this FPS Roguelike, you'll be fighting enemies and bosses with distinctive behaviors while traversing through a procedurally generated Aztecan temple. Finding game-changing weapon upgrade synergies and learning how to hastily maneuver through the temple will be key if you want to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Up Your Weapons With Synergistic Upgrades</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.poster.avif?t=1709159007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.webm?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/0419a2fdcd9625aceaacf4e3f2ce5ffe.mp4?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Avanzar is an FPS Roguelike that handles weapon upgrades like no other. Want to shoot homing bees instead of bullets? You got it! Want to put those bees on fire? Why not! <br><br>How about a gatling gun that briefly gains infinite ammo after each kill? We've got you covered. Gain nearly limitless possibilities by combining any weapon upgrades you want.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced Movement Mechanics</h2> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.poster.avif?t=1709159007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.webm?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1922480/extras/d7eda84a2b3b39f48cec414ec5ac262a.mp4?t=1709159007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br